{"id":"kc.biology.molecular-basis-of-inheritance.types-in-bacteria-there-are-three-2","v":1,"subject":"biology","chapterKey":"biology.molecular-basis-of-inheritance","chapter":"Molecular Basis of Inheritance","unit":"Genetics and Evolution","kind":"types","front":"Types of RNA in bacteria.","back":"mRNA (messenger RNA)\ntRNA (transfer RNA)\nrRNA (ribosomal RNA)","quote":"In bacteria, there are three major types of RNAs: mRNA (messenger RNA), tRNA (transfer RNA), and rRNA (ribosomal RNA).","blanks":[],"source":{"kind":"ncert","book":"Biology","code":"lebo105","chapterNo":5,"page":93,"section":"5.5.3 Types of RNA and the process of Transcription"},"importance":"must","asked":0,"tags":[],"order":910},
{"id":"kc.biology.molecular-basis-of-inheritance.list-the-mrna-provides-the-template-4","v":1,"subject":"biology","chapterKey":"biology.molecular-basis-of-inheritance","chapter":"Molecular Basis of Inheritance","unit":"Genetics and Evolution","kind":"list","front":"Roles of mRNA, tRNA and rRNA in protein synthesis.","back":"The mRNA provides the template\ntRNA brings aminoacids and reads the genetic code\nrRNAs play structural and catalytic role during translation","quote":"The mRNA provides the template, tRNA brings aminoacids and reads the genetic code, and rRNAs play structural and catalytic role during translation.","blanks":[],"source":{"kind":"ncert","book":"Biology","code":"lebo105","chapterNo":5,"page":93,"section":"5.5.3 Types of RNA and the process of Transcription"},"importance":"must","asked":0,"tags":[],"order":920},
