{"id":"kc.biology.molecular-basis-of-inheritance.fact-once-the-polymerases-reaches-the-49","v":1,"subject":"biology","chapterKey":"biology.molecular-basis-of-inheritance","chapter":"Molecular Basis of Inheritance","unit":"Genetics and Evolution","kind":"fact","front":"How does transcription terminate in bacteria?","back":"Once the polymerases reaches the terminator region, the nascent RNA falls off, so also the RNA polymerase. This results in termination of transcription.","quote":"Once the polymerases reaches the terminator region, the nascent RNA falls off, so also the RNA polymerase. This results in termination of transcription.","blanks":[],"source":{"kind":"ncert","book":"Biology","code":"lebo105","chapterNo":5,"page":94,"section":"5.5.3 Types of RNA and the process of Transcription"},"importance":"must","asked":0,"tags":[],"order":940},
