{"id":"kc.biology.molecular-basis-of-inheritance.fact-some-exceptions-to-this-rule-61","v":1,"subject":"biology","chapterKey":"biology.molecular-basis-of-inheritance","chapter":"Molecular Basis of Inheritance","unit":"Genetics and Evolution","kind":"fact","front":"Where have exceptions to the universality of the genetic code been found?","back":"Some exceptions to this rule have been found in mitochondrial codons, and in some protozoans.","quote":"Some exceptions to this rule have been found in mitochondrial codons, and in some protozoans.","blanks":[],"source":{"kind":"ncert","book":"Biology","code":"lebo105","chapterNo":5,"page":96,"section":"5.6 Genetic Code"},"importance":"good","asked":0,"tags":[],"order":1140},
